Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 14:38:55 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Velocity forwarding codec in horizon-protocol, with the
 proxy's side

The codec moves from the client's lan/forwarding.rs (which re-exports it) to
horizon-protocol, so a proxy can build the answer without the game: `sign`
writes what `verify` reads. Signing the recorded Velocity 4.3.1 answer gives
its exact bytes.

